    "content": "<!-- wp:cil/page-head {\"eyebrow\":\"Written instructions \u00b7 Videos \u00b7 Follow-up\",\"title\":\"Aftercare\",\"lede\":\"Good aftercare is an important part of the service. Before you leave the clinic, we explain what to expect, show you what you need to do and give you written instructions. Preparation and aftercare videos are also available for the relevant age group and method.\",\"reviewedBy\":\"\\u003ca href=\\u0022/team/#haidar\\u0022\\u003eDr Haidar Al-Ali, BDS, MFDS RCPS (Glasg)\\u003c/a\\u003e, September 2026\",\"crumbs\":[{\"label\":\"Aftercare\",\"href\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-card edge\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"aftercare-videos\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-card edge\" id=\"aftercare-videos\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"eyebrow\":\"Aftercare videos\",\"heading\":\"Explanation videos\",\"lede\":\"Please click on the ages below to watch a collection of videos relevant to that particular age group\",\"display\":\"d-2\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/group-cards {\"level\":3,\"banded\":false,\"items\":[{\"href\":\"/babies-toddlers-circumcision-videos/\",\"age\":\"Babies and toddlers\",\"title\":\"0\u20132y\",\"price\":\"\",\"blurb\":\"\",\"cta\":\"Watch the 0\u20132y videos\"},{\"href\":\"/children-circumcision-videos/\",\"age\":\"Children\",\"title\":\"3\u201313y\",\"price\":\"\",\"blurb\":\"\",\"cta\":\"Watch the 3\u201313y videos\"},{\"href\":\"/adult-circumcision-videos/\",\"age\":\"Teenagers and adults\",\"title\":\"14+ yrs and adults\",\"price\":\"\",\"blurb\":\"\",\"cta\":\"Watch the 14+ yrs and adults videos\"}]} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section-sm\",\"band\":\"bg-navy\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section-sm bg-navy\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"eyebrow\":\"Overview\",\"heading\":\"Aftercare topics covered by the clinic\",\"lede\":\"This page is an overview. Do not treat it as a substitute for the clinic's current aftercare sheets and videos.\",\"display\":\"d-2\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/info-cards {\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Baby/toddler ring-method aftercare\",\"body\":\"Written instructions and videos are provided for the Plastibell or Circumplast ring method. See also the \\u003ca href=\\u0022/babies/\\u0022\\u003ebabies and toddlers\\u003c/a\\u003e page.\"},{\"title\":\"Children's forceps-guided aftercare\",\"body\":\"Aftercare for older children is explained before you leave. See the \\u003ca href=\\u0022/children/\\u0022\\u003echildren and teenagers\\u003c/a\\u003e page.\"},{\"title\":\"Adult forceps-guided aftercare\",\"body\":\"Adult aftercare is given in writing before you leave. See the \\u003ca href=\\u0022/adults/\\u0022\\u003eadult circumcision\\u003c/a\\u003e page.\"},{\"title\":\"Nappies or underwear\",\"body\":\"Guidance on nappies or underwear is included in the written instructions for the method used.\"},{\"title\":\"Cleaning and keeping the area dry\",\"body\":\"The clinic shows you what you need to do and gives you written instructions before you leave.\"},{\"title\":\"What normal healing can look like\",\"body\":\"Preparation and aftercare videos are available for the relevant age group and method.\"},{\"title\":\"What to do if there is bleeding\",\"body\":\"Follow the written aftercare sheet given to you. Contact the clinic if you are concerned.\"},{\"title\":\"Special advice for a buried penis\",\"body\":\"See the \\u003ca href=\\u0022/buried-penis/\\u0022\\u003eburied penis\\u003c/a\\u003e page and follow the method-specific instructions given at the clinic.\"},{\"title\":\"When to contact the clinic\",\"body\":\"We contact patients or parents the day after the circumcision to check progress and understanding of the aftercare. Follow-up appointments during the healing period are included where needed.\"}]} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"emergency-contact\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\" id=\"emergency-contact\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"eyebrow\":\"When to seek urgent help\",\"heading\":\"Emergency contact\",\"display\":\"d-2\",\"lede\":\"Use the emergency contact instructions supplied by the clinic if you are concerned after a procedure. If there is a medical emergency and the clinic cannot be reached, use the appropriate NHS emergency service and take the aftercare information with you.\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/info-cards {\"columns\":\"g-3\",\"headingLevel\":3,\"items\":[{\"title\":\"During opening hours\",\"html\":\"<p><a href=\\\"tel:+442089513794\\\" data-track=\\\"call-aftercare\\\">020 8951 3794</a></p>\"},{\"title\":\"Out of hours\",\"html\":\"<p>The number on your aftercare sheet</p>\"},{\"title\":\"By message\",\"html\":\"<p><a href=\\\"https://wa.me/447886779958\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" data-track=\\\"whatsapp-aftercare\\\">WhatsApp</a></p>\"},{\"title\":\"Cannot reach us\",\"html\":\"<p>A&amp;E, or 111 for advice</p>\"},{\"title\":\"Next-day call\",\"html\":\"<p>We ring you, you do not chase us</p>\"},{\"title\":\"Follow-up visits\",\"html\":\"<p>Included until healed</p>\"}]} /--><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Photographs sent on WhatsApp are genuinely useful and we are asked for that constantly. Send one if it helps.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/cta-band {\"title\":\"If you have further questions\",\"text\":\"<p>If you have further questions, you can either <a href=\\\"tel:+442089513794\\\">call us</a> or <a href=\\\"#request-callback\\\">request for us to call you back</a>. You can also send us an email enquiry or speak to us via Whatsapp.</p><p class=\\\"cil-cta-contacts\\\"><a class=\\\"cil-cta-contact cil-cta-contact--email\\\" href=\\\"mailto:info@circumcisioninlondon.co.uk\\\"><span class=\\\"cil-cta-contact__label\\\">Email</span>info@circumcisioninlondon.co.uk</a><a class=\\\"cil-cta-contact cil-cta-contact--whatsapp\\\" href=\\\"https://wa.me/447886779958\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" data-track=\\\"whatsapp-cta\\\"><span class=\\\"cil-cta-contact__label\\\">WhatsApp</span>07886779958</a></p>\",\"eyebrow\":\"Talk to us\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Book online\",\"ctaUrl\":\"/book/\",\"phoneLabel\":\"Call 020 8951 3794\",\"phoneUrl\":\"tel:+442089513794\",\"cardTitle\":\"\",\"cardHtml\":\"\",\"cardEyebrow\":\"Request a call back\",\"showCallback\":true,\"formId\":\"aftercare\",\"formSubject\":\"aftercare page callback\",\"callbackAnchor\":\"request-callback\",\"nameLabel\":\"Your name\",\"phoneFieldLabel\":\"Phone number\",\"dobLabel\":\"Patient DOB\",\"messageLabel\":\"Anything you would like us to know\",\"optionalLabel\":\"(optional)\",\"consentHtml\":\"I am happy for the clinic to contact me about this enquiry. We do not add you to a mailing list. See our <a href=\\\"/privacy-notice/\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--blue-deep)\\\">privacy notice</a>.\",\"submitLabel\":\"Request a call back\",\"invalidMessage\":\"Please complete the highlighted field.\",\"sentMessage\":\"Opening your email app so this reaches the clinic. If nothing happens, call 020 8951 3794.\"} /-->"
}
